---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ConceptImage from '../components/ConceptImage.astro';
import Arrow from '../components/Arrow.astro';
import FAQ from '../components/FAQ.astro';
import ContactCTA from '../components/ContactCTA.astro';
import ArticleCard from '../components/ArticleCard.astro';
import ProjectStory from '../components/ProjectStory.astro';
import { articles } from '../data/journal';
import { services, process, homeFAQs } from '../data/site';
---
<BaseLayout title="Kitchen & Bathroom Remodeling in Bryan–College Station" description="Discuss your kitchen or bathroom remodel with M&H Construction. Serving Bryan, College Station, and Brazos County with a personal approach.">
  <section class="hero container">
    <div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow">M&amp;H CONSTRUCTION · BRYAN–COLLEGE STATION</p><h1>Beautiful spaces.<br /><em>Built around you.</em></h1><p class="hero-description">Kitchen &amp; bathroom remodeling in Bryan–College Station. Thoughtful planning, personal service, and a home that feels like yours.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button" href="/contact/">Discuss Your Project <Arrow /></a><a class="text-link" href="#services">Explore Our Services <Arrow direction="down" /></a></div></div>
    <div class="hero-image-wrap"><ConceptImage src={services[0].image} alt={services[0].alt} class="hero-image" eager /><div class="hero-note"><span>KITCHENS &amp; BATHROOMS</span><span>Made for everyday living.</span></div></div>
  </section>
  <div class="principles container"><span>Thoughtful craftsmanship</span><span>A personal approach</span><span>Rooted in Brazos County</span></div>
  <section class="section container" id="services">
    <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">THE SPACES THAT MATTER MOST</p><h2>Kitchen &amp; Bathroom<br /><em>Remodeling.</em></h2></div><p>From the first cup of coffee to the last quiet moment of the day, your home should work beautifully for you.</p></div>
    <div class="service-grid">{services.map((service, index) => <article class="service-card"><a href={`/${service.slug}/`} class="service-image-link" aria-label={`Explore ${service.name}`}><ConceptImage src={service.image} alt={service.alt} /></a><div class="service-card-heading"><span class="number">0{index + 1}</span><h3><a href={`/${service.slug}/`}>{service.name}</a></h3><a class="round-link" href={`/${service.slug}/`} aria-label={`Explore ${service.name}`}><Arrow /></a></div><p>{service.description}</p></article>)}</div>
  </section>
  <section class="section container home-project"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">THE PORTFOLIO · A LOOK AHEAD</p><h2>A closer look at<br /><em>the details.</em></h2></div><p>A preview of our project-story layout, using an illustrative design concept.</p></div><ProjectStory service={services[0]} compact /></section>
  <section class="approach-section"><div class="container approach-grid"><div class="approach-title"><p class="eyebrow">A HOME THAT FEELS LIKE YOU</p><h2>Remodeling around<br /><em>your priorities.</em></h2><a class="text-link" href="/about/">Get to Know M&amp;H <Arrow /></a></div><div class="approach-copy"><p class="large-copy">Good remodeling begins with a conversation about how you want to live.</p><p>You might have a folder full of inspiration, a finished plan, or simply a space you know could feel better. We meet you where you are, with design assistance or construction based on the needs of your project.</p><div class="approach-details"><div><span class="eyebrow">YOUR HOME</span><p>An approach shaped around your priorities.</p></div><div><span class="eyebrow">YOUR VISION</span><p>Room for your ideas, with guidance where needed.</p></div></div></div></div></section>
  <section class="section container process-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">FROM AN IDEA TO A NEW CHAPTER</p><h2>Your Remodeling Process.</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/our-process/">Our Remodeling Process <Arrow /></a></div><div class="process-grid">{process.map((step, index) => <article><span class="step-number">0{index + 1}</span><h3>{step.title}</h3><p>{step.text}</p></article>)}</div></section>
  <section class="area-strip"><div class="container area-inner"><div><p class="eyebrow">LOCAL ROOTS. PERSONAL CONNECTION.</p><h2>At home in Brazos County.</h2></div><div><p>Serving Bryan, College Station, and Brazos County.<br />A little farther out? Let’s talk about your project.</p><a class="text-link" href="/service-areas/">Explore Our Service Area <Arrow /></a></div></div></section>
  <section class="section container faq-section"><div><p class="eyebrow">BEFORE WE GET STARTED</p><h2>Your Remodeling<br /><em>Questions.</em></h2></div><FAQ items={homeFAQs} /></section>
  <section class="section container home-journal"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">THE REMODELING JOURNAL</p><h2>Kitchen &amp; Bathroom<br /><em>Planning Guides.</em></h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/resources/">Explore the Journal <Arrow /></a></div><div class="resource-grid">{articles.slice(0,3).map(article => <ArticleCard article={article} />)}</div></section>
  <ContactCTA />
</BaseLayout>
